<title>USA: Omaha hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher. Top $62.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3    230-260 lbs    62.00-62.50</p>
<p>US  2-3    260-280 lbs    61.00-61.50</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. Steady to 1.00 higher. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     350-450 lbs    47.00-47.50</p>
<p>	     450-500 lbs    48.00</p>
<p>US 2-3     500-650 lbs    48.50-49.00</p>
</text>
